{"5327390":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Retro Chaos: Together Tidy Up","steam_appid":5327390,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean up the mess. Together.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The retro electronics store is a disaster: CRT monitors on the floor, consoles in the headphone aisle, cartridges everywhere. Grab your friends, split up the aisles and turn the chaos back into perfectly stocked shelves — or make it even worse along the way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/a6c9450e5a7cbc78a0da3c7b888fa707.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/a6c9450e5a7cbc78a0da3c7b888fa707.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/a6c9450e5a7cbc78a0da3c7b888fa707.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw it. Catch it. Stock it.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/dc68822dd81f0c04e21c56e06016e45d.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/dc68822dd81f0c04e21c56e06016e45d.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/dc68822dd81f0c04e21c56e06016e45d.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Play solo or in online co-op with up to 4 players. Toss products across the aisle, catch a teammate's throw mid-air and argue about who put the headphones with the TVs. Built-in voice chat keeps the yelling close.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack it high<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/c328a36b9fbdb1d1e9d4916f1c78d00d.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/c328a36b9fbdb1d1e9d4916f1c78d00d.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/c328a36b9fbdb1d1e9d4916f1c78d00d.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Carry towering stacks of CRTs, consoles and cassettes — if you can keep them balanced. Every product has its own place across seven sections: Audio, Computer Parts, Games &amp; Consoles, Monitors, Phones, TVs and Gadgets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab it first<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/6ebdba85f70a5fcd7c9771c1e32f9630.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/6ebdba85f70a5fcd7c9771c1e32f9630.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/6ebdba85f70a5fcd7c9771c1e32f9630.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Your friends are also your competition. Snatch the product they were about to shelve, beat them to the right aisle, or just throw it back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From total chaos to the perfect shelf<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/b32096f2333dea6db2777e652f706c06.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/b32096f2333dea6db2777e652f706c06.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/b32096f2333dea6db2777e652f706c06.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Find the right shelf, fill every slot and watch the store come back to life. Earn money for every correctly placed item and unlock skills like Magnet Hands, Long Arms, Full Hands, Trick Shot, Sprint and Quick Stock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or online co-op for up to 4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of retro gadgets to sort across 7 store sections<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw, catch and stack products with physics-based chaos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill tree full of tidy upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 characters to choose from in the wardrobe<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in voice chat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy neon-lit retro store with its own music station<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean up the mess. Together.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The retro electronics store is a disaster: CRT monitors on the floor, consoles in the headphone aisle, cartridges everywhere. Grab your friends, split up the aisles and turn the chaos back into perfectly stocked shelves — or make it even worse along the way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/a6c9450e5a7cbc78a0da3c7b888fa707.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/a6c9450e5a7cbc78a0da3c7b888fa707.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/a6c9450e5a7cbc78a0da3c7b888fa707.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw it. Catch it. Stock it.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/dc68822dd81f0c04e21c56e06016e45d.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/dc68822dd81f0c04e21c56e06016e45d.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/dc68822dd81f0c04e21c56e06016e45d.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Play solo or in online co-op with up to 4 players. Toss products across the aisle, catch a teammate's throw mid-air and argue about who put the headphones with the TVs. Built-in voice chat keeps the yelling close.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack it high<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/c328a36b9fbdb1d1e9d4916f1c78d00d.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/c328a36b9fbdb1d1e9d4916f1c78d00d.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/c328a36b9fbdb1d1e9d4916f1c78d00d.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Carry towering stacks of CRTs, consoles and cassettes — if you can keep them balanced. Every product has its own place across seven sections: Audio, Computer Parts, Games &amp; Consoles, Monitors, Phones, TVs and Gadgets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab it first<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/6ebdba85f70a5fcd7c9771c1e32f9630.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/6ebdba85f70a5fcd7c9771c1e32f9630.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/6ebdba85f70a5fcd7c9771c1e32f9630.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Your friends are also your competition. Snatch the product they were about to shelve, beat them to the right aisle, or just throw it back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From total chaos to the perfect shelf<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/b32096f2333dea6db2777e652f706c06.poster.avif?t=1793729744\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/b32096f2333dea6db2777e652f706c06.webm?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/extras\/b32096f2333dea6db2777e652f706c06.mp4?t=1793729744\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Find the right shelf, fill every slot and watch the store come back to life. Earn money for every correctly placed item and unlock skills like Magnet Hands, Long Arms, Full Hands, Trick Shot, Sprint and Quick Stock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or online co-op for up to 4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of retro gadgets to sort across 7 store sections<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw, catch and stack products with physics-based chaos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill tree full of tidy upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 characters to choose from in the wardrobe<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in voice chat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy neon-lit retro store with its own music station<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A chaotic co-op organizing sim in a retro electronics store. Team up with up to 3 friends to sort thousands of CRTs, consoles and gadgets — throw, catch, stack and stock your way from total mess to the perfect shelf.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5327390\/e9a2c3c6328fa6786d93d51997a8ee5498951d60\/header.jpg?t=1793729744","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_a